--- task
id: s05
dataset: social
kind: insert an edge
answer: fewest

--- intent
Record that `$who` liked the comment `$comment`.

--- params
{"who": "raf", "comment": "c3"}

--- edition2
query like($who: String, $comment: String) {
  insert LikesComment { from: $who, to: $comment }
}

--- edition3
query like($who: String, $comment: String) {
  insert LikesComment { from: $who, to: $comment }
}

--- check
query check($comment: String) {
  match { $c: Comment { slug: $comment }  $p likesComment $c }
  return { $p.slug }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["p.slug"]
["ann"]
["raf"]
